WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.392
Unit twenty-four. Stretch and Move!

2
00:00:04.361 --> 00:00:08.139
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.189 --> 00:00:11.512
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.562 --> 00:00:15.307
Today we learn about Stretch and Move. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.235 --> 00:00:19.685
Stretch. Say it with me. Stretch!

6
00:00:23.184 --> 00:00:26.401
Move. Say it with me. Move!

7
00:00:29.887 --> 00:00:33.487
Arms. Say it with me. Arms!

8
00:00:36.989 --> 00:00:40.456
Legs. Say it with me. Legs!

9
00:00:43.955 --> 00:00:47.021
Bend. Say it with me. Bend!

10
00:00:50.518 --> 00:00:53.718
Reach. Say it with me. Reach!

11
00:00:57.223 --> 00:01:00.440
Body. Say it with me. Body!

12
00:01:03.945 --> 00:01:07.645
Strong. Say it with me. Strong!

13
00:01:11.139 --> 00:01:19.368
I stretch my arms and legs every morning. I bend, reach, and move my body. Moving every day keeps me strong and flexible.

14
00:01:19.418 --> 00:01:20.754
I can do that too!

15
00:01:21.936 --> 00:01:26.959
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:27.009 --> 00:01:28.159
Arms!

17
00:01:29.164 --> 00:01:34.333
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:34.383 --> 00:01:35.500
Body!

19
00:01:36.198 --> 00:01:42.142
Did you know? Getting up to move after sitting for a long time helps your body and brain!

20
00:01:42.192 --> 00:01:44.209
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:45.081 --> 00:01:52.265
Think and answer. Which stretch do you like best?

22
00:01:52.315 --> 00:01:53.465
Great answer!

23
00:01:54.682 --> 00:01:59.443
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:01:59.493 --> 00:02:02.206
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

